What:		/sys/class/leds/vibrator/amplitude
Date:		October 2026
Contact:	ikwfahmi <mikhwanfahmi4@gmail.com>
Description:
		Read or set the QPNP haptics amplitude from 1 to 255.
		255 preserves the configured voltage; smaller values scale it
		down, subject to the PMIC's minimum voltage and voltage steps.
		The configured vmax_mv and overdrive selection are retained.
		Stopping vibration remains controlled by the activate node.
